# Legibility Office n8n Templates

## Purpose

This directory contains reusable workflow templates that implement the Legibility Office Institutional Operating System (IOS).

Unlike workflows, templates are designed to be imported, configured, and adapted by governments, development finance institutions, researchers, and public sector organizations.

---

